    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1895 the village changed its name from Calumet to Laurium, after the ancient Greek mining town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laurium%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The village once housed the largest houses of Keweenaw’s wealthy, many still standing as part of the Keweenaw National Historical Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
